    "notes": "The actually inspected2015Coast Guard published photograph establishes the square low base, tall tapered polygonal shaft with long recessed face panels and narrow windows, projecting octagonal watchroom, railed gallery, glazed lantern/roof and exterior ladder. Current whole/base/recess/watchroom/gallery renders retain those defining forms at approximate medium-fi scope. Shadowed color, bottom threshold, hidden faces, precise mouldings/railing/ladder details and intermediate measurements remain estimates from retained native-plan/architectural controls. Published84ft total is an approximate operator control. Adjacent ruined warden house, prison, flags, industrial buildings and island terrain are outside this separate tower asset. No photo pixels are embedded.",
